CONTROLLED HYPERLAPSE 

Hyperlaps Inferno Style - (15 seconds · 30fps · 9:16)
Hyperlapse philosophy: {Only two bursts; Each is 0.4–0.6 seconds; Each follows a fire ribbon path, avoiding chaotic background motion; Everything else remains stable and smooth}

SCENES

ANCHOR (0.0–0.3s)
Use the uploaded image as the opening dynamic frame. Flame flicker only.

